      "text": [
        "628 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «أَقْرَبُ مَا يَكُونَ اَلْعَبْدُ إِلَى اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ وَ هُوَ سَاجِدٌ"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.628 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"The closest a servant is to Allah (swt), the Mighty and Majestic, is when he is in prostration (Sujood)”."
        ]
      }
